          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene bakabiza bashitiigwa, būkūgomela. Ī shilagīlo shako būshinhīla ngongo; būyūbabūlaga a bahangi bako abo babahūgūlaga gīkī bakūshokele, bīīta mihayo mitaale ya būsondagūji būbi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū bebe ūbatūūla mu makono ga banishi babo, būbaluhya; alīyo aho baluhiwa na a banishi babo būkūlīlīīla, nang'ho īkī ūlī na shigongo shitaale, ūbigwa kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū, ūbatūmīla bapīja ba kūbapīja kūfuma ū mu makono ga banishi babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho balembeela dūhū, bīīta hangī yabūbi ū mu miso gako. Nang'ho ūbaleka hangī mu makono ga banishi babo būbasuga. Alīyo aho balīla hangī, wigwa kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū. Īkī ūlī na shigongo shitaale wikalaga ū kūbapījaga ng'hangala na ng'hangala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabahūgūla gīkī bashishokele hangī ī shilagīlo shako, būdalaha dūhū, būleka ū kūgigwa a malange gako, bīīta shibi kūlwa kūshidalaha ī shilagīlo shako, īsho ūlū munhū ūshishikīlīja akūbiza mpanga. Ū mu būgūnu wabo wenūbo būkwinhīla ngongo, būjigang'hanaja nhingo, būlema ū kwigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkakwīla ī myaka ūkwiyūmīlījaga nabo, kūnū ūkūbahūgūlaga na Moyo wako, mu nzīla ya bahangi; alīyo nahene batadīlīīlile. Hūna lūūlū ūbatūūla mu makono ga mahanga ga banhū abo baalī bazenganilwe nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī ūlī na shigongo shitaale, ūtabamalile pye, nūūlū ūtabalekanīgije; nguno ū bebe ūlī Mulungu nchīji wa shigongo, na nsaatwa wa banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū ī haha SEEBA Mulungu wise, bebe ūyo ūlī Mulungu ntaale, na wa būdūla, hangī wa kogohwa; bebe ūyo ūkadimīīlaga ilagane lyako mu būtogwa būtī wa kūshila, ūtizūgabona a makoye gise gīkī galī mado; a makoye genayo gaatūgwīla a bise banhū bako kwandīja mu shikū ja batemi ba Baashulu kūshisha lelo īyī. Tūlī mu makoye mataale no a bise benekīlī na a batemi bise, na a batongeeji bise na a bagabīji bise, pye na a bahangi bise na basīswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu yose īyo yatūgwīlaga, ū bebe ūkatūmamīlaga būtūngīlīja gwa; ūkīītaga mu wishigwa, alīyo a bise twīta mu būhūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batemi bise, na a batongeeji bise, na a bagabīji bise, na a basīswe, batashilondeelile ī shilagīlo shako, batagadīlīlile a malange gako, nūūlū ū būhūgūji ūbo wabinhaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū aho balī ū mu būtemi wabo, aho babūyegelaga ū wiza wako būtaale ū kūbo, ūbo wabīītīlaga ū mu sī īyo walī wabinha ī ngalī na yawiza, nahene batakūtūmamīlile ū bebe, nūūlū batagalūkile balekane nī nzīla jabo ī jabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlībona ī haha gīkī tūlī basese, basese mu sī īyo walī wabinha bakūlūgenji bise, gīkī bagalūmbe a matwajo gaamo, nī shikolo shawiza ī shabūyaga īsho shikigelaga moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī yenīyī īlī na shikolo shingī no, alīyo kūlwa nguno ya shibi shise, ī shikolo shayo pyī ī shose shikajanagwa na batemi abo wabīīta kūbiza basugi bise. Batūsugile a bise benekīlī, nī mitugo jise, na lūūlū bakatwītīlaga ūmo batogelilwe boi benekīlī; nīyo tūlī mu makoye mataale no!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abo bakatūūla mina gabo h'ilagane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
